for c in checks.values():
 for p in c['evidence_paths']:assert (R/p).is_file() and (R/p).stat().st_size>0
(R/'session-state.md').write_text('Review complete: revise for unavailable source replays q-20598/q-20589/e-4709; minimal failure in reproduce_missing.py and missing-reproduction.json. Seven other checks pass with stated limits. Native 146 accepted/584 rejected; exact math 146 raw + 65 normalized. Actual UI representatives, pairs and normalized batch rendered. Pedagogical variation schema validated using system jsonschema. Inventory assessed; affected_questions empty for this omission. Final report review-result.json. Package hashes unchanged; no database writes/publication.\n')
